# minimini (MiniMini, macOS) — YubiKey 5C Nano, serial 16946249
# Public halves of resident FIDO2 credentials. Safe to commit.
#
# This is the YubiKey the registry previously attributed to am-jallen,
# which was renamed to paperweight; the key now lives with MiniMini.
#
# ssh:minimini-notouch — minted 0x20 (no touch, no PIN) for unattended agent
# sessions. Deliberately NOT registered on GitHub, matching ssh:chonky-notouch.
no-touch-required sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAAGnNrLXNzaC1lZDI1NTE5QG9wZW5zc2guY29tAAAAILkw9nSZwPe2GUPWSbzfbwnNefU6Cq2Lycb1sUdl7jbVAAAAFHNzaDptaW5pbWluaS1ub3RvdWNo minimini no-touch auth
# ssh:github — 0x21 (touch, no PIN). Touch-required fallback so a failure of
# the no-touch credential cannot lock MiniMini out. Deployed as ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_sk.
sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAAGnNrLXNzaC1lZDI1NTE5QG9wZW5zc2guY29tAAAAIFnK4sN/yjerurp+7MBdNXy0wwZPni5RUGWuuKfLqgprAAAACnNzaDpnaXRodWI= minimini touch fallback
